# pr-watch.items — the PR/issue items the opencode PR watcher (`.opencode/plugins/pr-watch.ts`)
# watches via the generic `marketplace/scripts/gh_watch.sh`.
#
# One item per line: `owner/repo#num`, `owner/repo/pull/num`, `owner/repo/issues/num`,
# or a full https://github.com/owner/repo/(pull|issues)/num URL.
# Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
#
# This shipped file is comment-only, so the watcher is INERT by default.
# Uncomment (or add) a line below to arm it, then RESTART opencode (plugins load once).
#
# acme/widget#12
